{"summary":"Run fast! Run Fancy!","description":"Run through dense forests, underwater caverns, and pirate ships in search of your kidnapped sister in this epic platformer game. Stomp, kick, and slash your enemies with 40 melee weapons and an arsenal of moves. Battle Pirates, Ninjas, a Giant Penguin and more! \n\nFeatures:\n\n- Plenty of platform levels filled with secret rooms\n- Parkour style gameplay\n- Many challenges and races.\n- Unlockables: hats, weapons and PANTS!\n- World 1 and World 2 can also be unlocked.\n- Gamepad support!\n- Leaderboards and achievements\n- Stickman / hand drawn art style \n\nJoin Fancy Pants Man in this platform game as you help rescue his little sister, Cutie Pants, from the worst pirates ever.\n\nLeap, slide, sprint and smash your way through some of the most unique levels to be found in gaming.\n\nFancy Pants Man will wield new weapons, take on new enemies and use a ton of new tricks and abilities on his way to rescuing his beloved sister.\n\nUnique hand-drawn artwork and gorgeous, colorful visual style.\n\nCollect the squiggles and stars spread throughout each stage and use them to unlock new awards, costumes and accessories.\n\nDeveloped by Brad Borne and Over the Top Games.","esrbNotes":"Violent References","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/f8DzH3tNAzs?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mgPGTIsMVsfEMECzEBr0_b-7gGeld7hS-vQ4dUYHEDGC7J0wjXD6Cq2aK3OmKSsIDjIlDKntSeesMX--UTZmB0Y","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jAuJDYNlUbfOFzp3k85AHvkh3TWvSo9d8Vcm9hR0PovRmIr_JyZ0jjHCytYvbkZmKD84Oq5bveTMHjcL8Au9cw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WbuRzavdYHLSr-50f82hNGD13l5GICCJjB-ch0KKlJsbqw8d856S6eAXyZwPzRs8aMAIS91acL1ww4rSdxDlcA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MLv1zHpkfl4CnVXh0W1xfQFxlDGKgMPeyx1c5zl857IkGG0FGGzUuWN7LR7Im-_Tj9pPPHm6ym6AiPvP9svw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tLNyAMygrwjwVCLzhsvnQ